56
00:02:28,314 --> 00:02:29,149
Oh. 

57
00:02:30,066 --> 00:02:31,401
Is it-- Did--

58
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:32,777
Huh. 

59
00:02:33,027 --> 00:02:33,945
I see.

60
00:02:34,612 --> 00:02:35,989
