65
00:02:49,752 --> 00:02:51,004
[Obie] Oh, hey, General.

66
00:02:51,087 --> 00:02:53,506
Have fun in Denver, sir.
I've always wanted to go to Denver.

67
00:02:53,590 --> 00:02:54,799
